ure  with curiosity she's never seen anything  like this being that moves like a living  thing yet doesn't seem to be alive  soon the autonomous probe finds their  sibling has not survived the crash they  will have to explore this strange New  World all on their own  but Eve follows the being which he names  felstar on a journey across the  Uncharted surface for she is alone as  well having not seen another intelligent  Reaper in over a decade  at first philstar spends their time  cataloging the world around them with  mechanical indifference but in time they  take notice of Eve who points out native  species to the Curious robot over time  felstar's personality grows bigger and  they learn to communicate with Eve  through gestures in imitation across the  widest chasms they Forge an unbreakable  Bond two lonely Souls isolated by space  and time ultimately find whatever they  need in each other they travel for many  seasons and find there is much to live  for eventually felstar no longer seems  to remember how or why they came here  the story never directly States what  kind of intelligent life made felstar  but given their avian appearance in  gentle nature it seems likely felstar is  an emissary from the sea stewards Planet  while the sea stewards no longer  remember Serena and having lost contact  with felstar may never find it again the  possibility that their civilization is  out there thriving somewhere in the  stars is a comfort after so much  devastation  yet eventually everything no matter how  extraordinary must come to an end one  might assume that felstar would last  beyond Eve or perhaps Beyond everything  but while felstar doesn't age or require  rest they're not immortal like most  machines felstar isn't built to function  forever and so they simply fall apart  piece by piece bit by bit over the years  like a skeleton upon the planes while  philstar doesn't mind Eve does using  scavenged parts to keep their dear  friend functioning long past their  natural lifespan while both of them know  felstar's end is near they make every  day the best they can exploring new  regions and cataloging new species when  no easy fixes remain in felstar can no  longer travel Eve brings specimens  directly to felstar instead small  Comforts to take their mind off the  inevitable Eve is prepared to take care  of felstar for ever but she knows they  don't want this philstar doesn't fear  the end of their Journey like organic  creatures do in the end felstar gestures  for Eve to sit beside them and they  spend one final moment together  when the spark fed his felstar finally  goes out all that is left is a cold  shell Eve knows that her friend is gone  she knows felstar's body will stay where  it lies Untouched by animals and plants  slowly falling apart into fragments but  never truly Vanishing it's not a sight  she can bear to see so not knowing what  else to do she moves on Reapers  typically Embrace solitude but Eve soon  finds that being alone is not the same  as being lonely in time she realizes  that felstar would want her to keep  exploring to see what else is out there  beyond the world they walk together so  she decides to keep the adventure alive  in memory of her friend and continue the  pursuit of discovery  setting out on her own Eve has been  forever changed through her time with  felstar and seeks to be a benevolent  force in an uncaring world she adopts an  orphan Fox Trotter whom she rears to  adulthood as if it were her own child  and in time she discovers other  intelligent Reapers like her and becomes  part of their flock and so felstar in  life and death is a catalyst for change  within Eve expanding her world view and  continuing an ancient chain of ideas  shared from one species to another even  after the sea stewards have long left  Serena  Eve's flock might very well be the last  group of Reapers Under the Sun but they  face their fate head-on for in the words  of the author everything has its  beginning and so too everything has its  end but until that time they will not  stop living they won't give up one never  knows how long their story might be but  the world is wide and life is full of  surprises  the story of Serena isn't over yet the  end Ultima scene an era home to some of  the most unique life forms of all is  just beginning but that's all I can give  away for now if you find this project as  incredible as I do I'd encourage you to  check out the main website Linked In the  description and read more of Dylan  beta's incredible project of Serena  and as always thanks for watching if you  enjoyed this entry please lend your  support by liking subscribing and  hitting the notification icon to stay up  to date on all things curious see you in  the next video

